#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/security.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "FreeAnima Security"
msgstr "逸灵风安全"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Adopted principles: [architecture.md](../concepts/architecture.md).\n"
"> Security review and implementation items: [GitHub Issue #33](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/33), [#46](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/46).\n"
msgstr ""
"> 已采纳原则：[architecture.md](../concepts/architecture.md)。\n"
"> 安全审查与实现项：[GitHub Issue #33](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/33)、[#46](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/46)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trust Model (Required Reading for Open-Source Deployment)"
msgstr "信任模型（开源部署必读）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:13
msgid "FreeAnima is designed for **single-user local / intranet** deployment:"
msgstr "逸灵风设计为**单人本地 / 内网**部署："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/security.md:17
msgid ""
"HTTP / Admin **has no auth by default**; binding `127.0.0.1` is not security—"
"any process or user that can reach the port can read conversations, send "
"messages, start/stop MCP/ACP."
msgstr ""
"HTTP / Admin **默认无鉴权**；绑定 `127.0.0.1` 不等于安全——任何能访问端口的进"
"程或用户均可读会话、发消息、启停 MCP/ACP。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/security.md:17
msgid ""
"Default bind is `127.0.0.1`; for LAN access, assess CORS and network "
"isolation yourself."
msgstr "默认 bind 为 `127.0.0.1`；若需局域网访问，请自行评估 CORS 与网络隔离。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/security.md:17
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Do not** expose the service to the public internet without "
#| "`remote_auth` (see [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md) — Tunnel + "
#| "Bearer token)."
msgid ""
"**Do not** expose the service to the public internet without a Service API "
"Token on clients (see [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md))."
msgstr ""
"**不要**在未配置 `remote_auth` 的情况下将服务暴露到公网（见 [`remote-"
"access.md`](remote-access.md) — Tunnel + Bearer token）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credential Responsibilities"
msgstr "凭证职责"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Rule                     | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Sole authoritative store | [pass](https://www.passwordstore.org/) (GPG, `~/.password-store`)                                                                                                                                               |\n"
"| Never commit secrets     | Do not write API keys, tokens, DB passwords into `config.yaml` and commit to git                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| Runtime directory        | `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) holds config, conversations, memory—recommend `chmod 700`                                                                                                            |\n"
"| CLI plaintext output     | `anima credential get` prints plaintext to stdout; do not redirect to shared logs                                                                                                                               |\n"
"| Admin credential detail  | `GET /api/credentials/detail?path=` returns pass plaintext to local Admin; same sensitivity as CLI; relies on bind address and process isolation                                                                |\n"
"| pass path conventions    | `api/opencode-go`, `services/cloudflare/api-token`, `services/cloudflare/tunnel-credentials`, `services/discord`, `services/firecrawl`, `services/postgres/anima`, `services/pushdeer`, `services/weixin-ilink` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 规则           | 说明                                                                                                                                 |\n"
"| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| 唯一权威存储   | [pass](https://www.passwordstore.org/)（GPG，`~/.password-store`）                                                                   |\n"
"| 禁止入库       | 勿将 API Key、Token、DB 密码写入 `config.yaml` 并提交 git                                                                            |\n"
"| 运行时目录     | `~/.anima/`（`FREEANIMA_HOME` 可改）含 config、会话、记忆——建议 `chmod 700`                                                          |\n"
"| CLI 明文输出   | `anima credential get` 向 stdout 打印明文；勿重定向到共享日志                                                                        |\n"
"| Admin 凭证详情 | `GET /api/credentials/detail?path=` 向本机 Admin 返回 pass 明文；与 CLI 同等敏感，依赖 bind 地址与进程隔离                           |\n"
"| pass 路径约定  | `api/opencode-go`、`services/cloudflare/api-token`、`services/cloudflare/tunnel-credentials`、`services/discord`、`services/firecrawl`、`services/postgres/anima`、`services/pushdeer`、`services/weixin-ilink` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:30
msgid ""
"`config.yaml` supports `credential(\"path\", \"field\")` and `env(\"KEY\")` "
"for secrets (e.g. `database.url: credential(\"services/postgres/anima\", "
"\"url\")` or `env(\"DATABASE_URL\")`); values are injected at runtime from "
"pass or the environment."
msgstr ""
"`config.yaml` 支持 `credential(\"path\", \"field\")` 与 `env(\"KEY\")` 引用密"
"钥（例如 `database.url: credential(\"services/postgres/anima\", \"url\")` 或 "
"`env(\"DATABASE_URL\")`）；运行时从 pass 或环境变量注入。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data Persistence"
msgstr "数据持久化"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path                            | Content             | Encryption                      |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n"
"| PostgreSQL conversation archive | sessions / messages | No application-layer encryption |\n"
"| `~/.anima/weixin/`              | WeChat sync state   | None                            |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 路径                | 内容                | 加密         |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------------------- | ------------ |\n"
"| PostgreSQL 对话存档 | sessions / messages | 无应用层加密 |\n"
"| `~/.anima/weixin/`  | 微信同步状态        | 无           |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:39
msgid "Disk backup = data access. Protect backup media accordingly."
msgstr "磁盘备份 = 数据访问。请妥善保护备份介质。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "LLM Tool Risks"
msgstr "LLM 工具风险"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Capability             | Risk                                                                                                                |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `terminal`             | Default `shell: true`, can run arbitrary shell commands                                                             |\n"
"| `file_read_file`       | Partial path deny (`.ssh` private keys, `/etc/passwd`, etc.); **not** full `/etc/` deny                             |\n"
"| `file_write_file`      | deny list + write-protected paths                                                                                   |\n"
"| MCP tools              | Capabilities entirely determined by external Server; stdio default, SSE auth scheme not fully defined               |\n"
"| Capability mask (Mask) | Conversation-level tool whitelist; `deny` overrides `allow`; LLM cannot see policy details; see `capabilities/mask` |\n"
"| ACP (Cursor)           | Default **auto-approve** all `session/request_permission` (`allow-once`)                                            |\n"
"| `credentials_list`     | Returns pass path metadata only, no values                                                                          |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 能力               | 风险                                                                                  |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `terminal`         | 默认 `shell: true`，可执行任意 shell 命令                                             |\n"
"| `file_read_file`   | 部分路径 deny（`.ssh` 私钥、`/etc/passwd` 等）；**未**全面 deny `/etc/`               |\n"
"| `file_write_file`  | deny list + 写保护路径                                                                |\n"
"| MCP 工具           | 能力完全由外部 Server 决定；stdio 默认，SSE 认证方案未完整定义                        |\n"
"| 能力面罩（Mask）   | 对话级工具白名单；`deny` 覆盖 `allow`；LLM 不可见策略细节；见 `capabilities/mask` |\n"
"| ACP（Cursor）      | 默认 **自动批准** 所有 `session/request_permission`（`allow-once`）                   |\n"
"| `credentials_list` | 仅返回 pass 路径元数据，不含值                                                        |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measures in Place"
msgstr "已有措施"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Measure                 | Description                                                                                                                            |\n"
"| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Same-origin RPC         | TanStack Start server functions same-origin by default, no CORS whitelist needed                                                       |\n"
"| Config secret redaction | `AppRuntime.getConfig()` → `sanitizeConfigForApi()` (`api_key`, `database.url`, nested `pushkey`, `mcp env`, etc.)                     |\n"
"| MCP config redaction    | `sanitizeMcpConfig`: `env` exposes only `env_keys`                                                                                     |\n"
"| Write path safety       | `file_write_file` deny list (partial `/etc/*`, `.ssh` private keys, etc.)                                                              |\n"
"| Slash commands          | Whitelist routing; every command must produce user-visible feedback; long-running commands send an immediate ack then the final result |\n"
"| MCP default stdio       | Reduces port exposure                                                                                                                  |\n"
"| Credential isolation    | LLM sees pass paths only, not values                                                                                                   |\n"
"| CI secret scanning      | `.github/workflows/security.yml` (Gitleaks); GitHub Secret scanning + Push protection (free for public repos)                          |\n"
"| `.gitignore`            | `.env.*`, `config.yaml`, private key suffixes                                                                                          |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 措施                 | 说明                                                                                                               |\n"
"| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| 同源 RPC             | TanStack Start server functions 默认同源，无需 CORS 白名单                                                          |\n"
"| 配置密钥脱敏         | `AppRuntime.getConfig()` → `sanitizeConfigForApi()`（`api_key`、`database.url`、嵌套 `pushkey`、`mcp env` 等）      |\n"
"| MCP 配置脱敏         | `sanitizeMcpConfig`：`env` 仅暴露 `env_keys`                                                                        |\n"
"| 写路径安全           | `file_write_file` deny list（部分 `/etc/*`、`.ssh` 私钥等）                                                         |\n"
"| 斜杠命令             | 白名单路由；每条命令须产生用户可见反馈；长时命令先立即 ack 再返回最终结果                                            |\n"
"| MCP 默认 stdio       | 减少端口暴露                                                                                                        |\n"
"| 凭证隔离             | LLM 仅见 pass 路径，不见值                                                                                          |\n"
"| CI 密钥扫描          | `.github/workflows/security.yml`（Gitleaks）；GitHub Secret scanning + Push protection（公开仓库免费）                |\n"
"| `.gitignore`         | `.env.*`、`config.yaml`、私钥后缀                                                                                   |\n"

