msgstr "以下在代码或文档中规划，**部署者请勿假设已实现**："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:79
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Priority | Item                                                  | Status                                                                                                                                  |\n"
#| "| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| P0       | file_read_file full deny (`/etc/` etc.)               | Partial                                                                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| P0       | `terminal_run` / `code_execute` default `shell=False` | Not implemented                                                                                                                         |\n"
#| "| P1       | Runtime Unix socket `chmod 600` + handshake token     | Not implemented                                                                                                                         |\n"
#| "| P1       | `FREEANIMA_WRITE_SAFE_ROOT` / `READ_SAFE_ROOT`        | Not implemented                                                                                                                         |\n"
#| "| P2       | HTTP API auth                                         | Non-loopback Host or non-loopback TCP peer requires `remote_auth` or 401; dual loopback exempt ([`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)) |\n"
#| "| P3       | IPC / LLM rate limiting                               | None                                                                                                                                    |\n"
#| "| P3       | Session disk encryption                               | None                                                                                                                                    |\n"
msgid ""
"| Priority | Item                                                  | Status                                                                                                           |\n"
"| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| P0       | file_read_file full deny (`/etc/` etc.)               | Partial                                                                                                          |\n"
"| P0       | `terminal_run` / `code_execute` default `shell=False` | Not implemented                                                                                                  |\n"
"| P1       | Runtime Unix socket `chmod 600` + handshake token     | Not implemented                                                                                                  |\n"
"| P1       | `FREEANIMA_WRITE_SAFE_ROOT` / `READ_SAFE_ROOT`        | Not implemented                                                                                                  |\n"
"| P2       | HTTP API auth                                         | 业务 API 须带 per-subject Service API Token；`GET /api/health` 豁免（见 [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)） |\n"
"| P3       | IPC / LLM rate limiting                               | None                                                                                                             |\n"
"| P3       | Session disk encryption                               | None                                                                                                             |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 优先级 | 项                                                    | 状态                                                                                                                         |\n"
"| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| P0     | file_read_file 全面 deny（`/etc/` 等）                | 部分                                                                                                                         |\n"
"| P0     | `terminal_run` / `code_execute` 默认 `shell=False`    | 未实现                                                                                                                       |\n"
"| P1     | Runtime Unix socket `chmod 600` + 握手 token            | 未实现                                                                                                                       |\n"
"| P1     | `FREEANIMA_WRITE_SAFE_ROOT` / `READ_SAFE_ROOT`        | 未实现                                                                                                                       |\n"
"| P2     | HTTP API 鉴权                                         | 非 loopback Host 或非 loopback TCP 对端须 `remote_auth` 否则 401；双 loopback 豁免（[`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)） |\n"
"| P3     | IPC / LLM 速率限制                                    | 无                                                                                                                           |\n"
"| P3     | 会话磁盘加密                                          | 无                                                                                                                           |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Threat Sources"
msgstr "威胁来源"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Code  | Name                | Description                                                      |\n"
"| ----- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **A** | External attack     | Unauthorized access, port exposure                               |\n"
"| **B** | LLM-layer injection | Prompt injection, tool parameter manipulation, command injection |\n"
"| **C** | Agent error         | Mistaken dangerous operations                                    |\n"
"| **D** | Dependency chain    | Third-party lib / MCP / ACP compromise                           |\n"
"| **E** | Data security       | Conversation leak, key leak, memory tampering                    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 代号  | 名称       | 说明                                |\n"
"| ----- | ---------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| **A** | 外网攻击   | 未授权访问、端口暴露                |\n"
"| **B** | LLM 层注入 | Prompt 注入、工具参数操纵、命令注入 |\n"
"| **C** | Agent 过失 | 误执行危险操作                      |\n"
"| **D** | 依赖链     | 三方库 / MCP / ACP 被攻陷           |\n"
"| **E** | 数据安全   | 对话泄露、密钥泄露、记忆篡改        |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/security.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security Matrix"
msgstr "安全矩阵"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/security.md:99
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Module           | A External                                | B LLM injection                                                     | C Agent error             | D Dependencies     | E Data                             |\n"
#| "| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| **Runtime**      | Default 127.0.0.1 bind                    | MaxTurnsExceeded                                                    | Gap: rate limiting        | llm client vulns   | PG unencrypted                     |\n"
#| "| **Gateway**      | Token in pass                             | Malicious messages                                                  | Reply with sensitive info | SDK vulns          | —                                  |\n"
#| "| **CLI / Tools**  | Local shell compromised                   | file_read_file partial deny (**P0 extending**); shell=True (**P0**) | rm -rf etc.               | —                  | Logs may contain conversations     |\n"
#| "| **HTTP / Admin** | `remote_auth` Bearer token (non-loopback) | BFF does not touch LLM params directly                              | config display            | Vue/axios          | SSE plaintext                      |\n"
#| "| **MCP / ACP**    | SSE auth undefined                        | Malicious params                                                    | Wrong delegation          | Server compromised | Context may contain sensitive data |\n"
msgid ""
"| Module           | A External                                                 | B LLM injection                                                     | C Agent error             | D Dependencies     | E Data                             |\n"
"| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Runtime**      | Default 127.0.0.1 bind                                     | MaxTurnsExceeded                                                    | Gap: rate limiting        | llm client vulns   | PG unencrypted                     |\n"
"| **Gateway**      | Token in pass                                              | Malicious messages                                                  | Reply with sensitive info | SDK vulns          | —                                  |\n"
"| **CLI / Tools**  | Local shell compromised                                    | file_read_file partial deny (**P0 extending**); shell=True (**P0**) | rm -rf etc.               | —                  | Logs may contain conversations     |\n"
"| **HTTP / Admin** | `service_api_tokens` Bearer token（所有来源，含 loopback） | BFF does not touch LLM params directly                              | config display            | Vue/axios          | SSE plaintext                      |\n"
"| **MCP / ACP**    | SSE auth undefined                                         | Malicious params                                                    | Wrong delegation          | Server compromised | Context may contain sensitive data |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 模块             | A 外网              | B LLM 注入                                                      | C Agent 过失     | D 依赖链        | E 数据           |\n"
"| ---------------- | ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- | --------------- | ---------------- |\n"
"| **Runtime**      | 默认 127.0.0.1 bind | MaxTurnsExceeded                                                | 缺口：速率限制   | llm client 漏洞 | PG 无加密        |\n"
"| **Gateway**      | Token 在 pass       | 恶意消息                                                        | 错误回复敏感信息 | SDK 漏洞        | —                |\n"
"| **CLI / Tools**  | 本地 shell 被攻陷   | file_read_file 部分 deny（**P0 扩展中**）；shell=True（**P0**） | rm -rf 等        | —               | 日志可能含对话   |\n"
"| **HTTP / Admin** | 非 loopback 须 `remote_auth` Bearer | BFF 不直连 LLM 参数                                             | config 展示      | Vue/axios       | SSE 明文         |\n"
"| **MCP / ACP**    | SSE 认证未定义      | 恶意参数                                                        | 错误委托         | Server 被攻陷   | 上下文含敏感数据 |\n"

